{"schemaVersion":1,"id":313,"sections":[{"id":"707001-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[20168],"start":0,"count":26},{"id":"707001-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[20169],"start":26,"count":14},{"id":"707002-PROLOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战前","scripts":[20170],"start":40,"count":31},{"id":"707002-EPILOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战后","scripts":[20171],"start":71,"count":35}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"707001-PROLOGUE:20168:0","scriptId":20168,"text":"回到死水之后——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"707001-PROLOGUE:20168:2","scriptId":20168,"text":"我把拜科努尔航天研究所的情况都一一汇报给了维多利亚团长。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707001-PROLOGUE:20168:3","scriptId":20168,"text":"“恩……到最后那些狐狸都没有现身是吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707001-PROLOGUE:20168:4","scriptId":20168,"text":"“是的……具体原因不明，但是的确有大批的狐型战车兽在研究所周边。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":554,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707001-PROLOGUE:20168:5","scriptId":20168,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":554,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707001-PROLOGUE:20168:6","scriptId":20168,"text":"“没办法，你也不可能为了蹲守这些狐狸驻扎在研究所那里，这种事情你只能让研究所自己想办法了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"707001-PROLOGUE:20168:7","scriptId":20168,"text":"维多利亚团长很简明扼要地发表了自己的看法。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707001-PROLOGUE:20168:8","scriptId":20168,"text":"“恩，是的，虽然有点挂心，不过奈乐还在，应该会有办法的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"707001-PROLOGUE:20168:9","scriptId":20168,"text":"维多利亚刚抬起手，看手势应该是让我出去了……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707001-PROLOGUE:20168:10","scriptId":20168,"text":"“好了，没事的话——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707001-PROLOGUE:20168:11","scriptId":20168,"text":"“等等，团长大人，我这里还有另一份报告。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":553,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707001-PROLOGUE:20168:12","scriptId":20168,"text":"“你小子竟然还藏了一手？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":553,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707001-PROLOGUE:20168:13","scriptId":20168,"text":"“因为这个报告有点特殊。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":553,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"707001-PROLOGUE:20168:14","scriptId":20168,"text":"我把第二份报告递给了维多利亚团长，是一个小信封。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":553,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"707001-PROLOGUE:20168:15","scriptId":20168,"text":"维多利亚拆开信封发现里面有不少东西，于是抖了抖——有几张小纸片掉了出来。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":553,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707001-PROLOGUE:20168:16","scriptId":20168,"text":"“哦？这是……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707001-PROLOGUE:20168:17","scriptId":20168,"text":"“在研究所发现的……具体的经过，您看一下我的报告书。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"707001-PROLOGUE:20168:18","scriptId":20168,"text":"维多利亚快速阅览了我的报告——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":557,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707001-PROLOGUE:20168:19","scriptId":20168,"text":"“不错嘛～竟然在那种情况下还做了这种调查。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":557,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707001-PROLOGUE:20168:20","scriptId":20168,"text":"“过奖了，只是因为出现了旅行者这个关键词，让我觉得很奇怪，于是就擅自做了调查。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":557,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":557,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707001-PROLOGUE:20168:21","scriptId":20168,"text":"“挺可以啊～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":557,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"707001-PROLOGUE:20168:22","scriptId":20168,"text":"维多利亚手里捏着那几张纸片看了又看，然后放入信封递还给我，只留下报告书。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":557,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707001-PROLOGUE:20168:23","scriptId":20168,"text":"“报告书我收下了，接下来你是准备找波西娅分析这纸片的密码是吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707001-PROLOGUE:20168:24","scriptId":20168,"text":"“是的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707001-PROLOGUE:20168:25","scriptId":20168,"text":"“那我就委任你全权调查这件事情，所有的经过和报告最后都要提交给我。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707001-PROLOGUE:20168:26","scriptId":20168,"text":"“遵命。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"707001-EPILOGUE:20169:1","scriptId":20169,"text":"另一处被旅行者占领的基地内——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":547,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":421,"speaker":"奥米克戎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"707001-EPILOGUE:20169:2","scriptId":20169,"text":"“听说已经抓到那几个研究员了？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":421,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":430,"speaker":"柯西","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"707001-EPILOGUE:20169:3","scriptId":20169,"text":"“是的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":421,"right":430,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"707001-EPILOGUE:20169:4","scriptId":20169,"text":"柯西很轻描淡写地回应了奥米克戎。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":421,"right":430,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":421,"speaker":"奥米克戎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"707001-EPILOGUE:20169:5","scriptId":20169,"text":"“那接下来的事情就不用我多说了吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":421,"right":430,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":430,"speaker":"柯西","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"707001-EPILOGUE:20169:6","scriptId":20169,"text":"“什么事情？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":421,"right":430,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"707001-EPILOGUE:20169:7","scriptId":20169,"text":"柯西有点困惑。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":421,"right":430,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":421,"speaker":"奥米克戎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"707001-EPILOGUE:20169:8","scriptId":20169,"text":"“之前不是说了嘛，把坐标从他们的脑袋里给我弄出来。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":421,"right":430,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":430,"speaker":"柯西","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"707001-EPILOGUE:20169:9","scriptId":20169,"text":"“那需要花费不少的时间啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":421,"right":430,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":421,"speaker":"奥米克戎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"707001-EPILOGUE:20169:10","scriptId":20169,"text":"“别给我磨磨蹭蹭的，这件事情如果能办妥，我们之前犯下的失误就都能被抵消了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":421,"right":430,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":430,"speaker":"柯西","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"707001-EPILOGUE:20169:11","scriptId":20169,"text":"“好吧好吧……我知道了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":421,"right":430,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"707001-EPILOGUE:20169:12","scriptId":20169,"text":"柯西一脸不耐烦得离开了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":421,"right":430,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":421,"speaker":"奥米克戎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"707001-EPILOGUE:20169:13","scriptId":20169,"text":"“那么下一步的计划也该准备起来了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":421,"right":430,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"707001-EPILOGUE:20169:14","scriptId":20169,"text":"奥米克戎消失在了房间的另一头。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":421,"right":430,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"707002-PROLOGUE:20170:0","scriptId":20170,"text":"离开团长室，我揣着那几张密码纸马不停蹄地赶到了波西娅的研究室。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":421,"right":430,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"707002-PROLOGUE:20170:2","scriptId":20170,"text":"一开门——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":421,"right":430,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":736,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707002-PROLOGUE:20170:3","scriptId":20170,"text":"“长官！你来啦！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":736,"right":430,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"707002-PROLOGUE:20170:4","scriptId":20170,"text":"只看到尤拉朝我奔来。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":736,"right":430,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707002-PROLOGUE:20170:5","scriptId":20170,"text":"“恩，已经得到了团长的委任，会彻底调查这份密码。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":736,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"707002-PROLOGUE:20170:6","scriptId":20170,"text":"这个时候波西娅从房间的内角慢慢走了过来。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":736,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707002-PROLOGUE:20170:7","scriptId":20170,"text":"“具体情况我已经听尤拉说了，是什么样子的密码？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707002-PROLOGUE:20170:8","scriptId":20170,"text":"“给。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"707002-PROLOGUE:20170:9","scriptId":20170,"text":"我把纸片递给波西娅，波西娅扫了一眼。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707002-PROLOGUE:20170:10","scriptId":20170,"text":"“嗯？这个是……典型的恩尼格玛密码。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707002-PROLOGUE:20170:11","scriptId":20170,"text":"“哦！？那就是说波西娅你能解开咯？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"707002-PROLOGUE:20170:12","scriptId":20170,"text":"在我满心期待地追问下，波西娅却只是吐了吐舌头。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707002-PROLOGUE:20170:13","scriptId":20170,"text":"“虽然我很想帮忙，但是解密这种密码是需要专门的解密工艺的，这方面不是我的长处。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707002-PROLOGUE:20170:14","scriptId":20170,"text":"“………………”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707002-PROLOGUE:20170:15","scriptId":20170,"text":"“不过不要急着失望，我可以介绍一个人给你认识，她说不定可以帮你解开这份密码。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707002-PROLOGUE:20170:16","scriptId":20170,"text":"“哦！？还请赐教～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707002-PROLOGUE:20170:17","scriptId":20170,"text":"“呵呵～你这表情真是丰富～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"707002-PROLOGUE:20170:18","scriptId":20170,"text":"波西娅走回自己的研究桌，掏出一份笔记本，翻了又翻。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"707002-PROLOGUE:20170:19","scriptId":20170,"text":"在翻到某一页时，她停了下来，拿出一张小纸片，在上面抄抄弄弄，随后合上了本子。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707002-PROLOGUE:20170:20","scriptId":20170,"text":"“给，这个是联系方式，你找到她的话，应该就能搞定这个密码了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707002-PROLOGUE:20170:21","scriptId":20170,"text":"“真是万分感谢！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707002-PROLOGUE:20170:22","scriptId":20170,"text":"“小事一桩。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"707002-PROLOGUE:20170:23","scriptId":20170,"text":"波西娅说到这里，一把拽住我的领带，把我拉到她的跟前。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707002-PROLOGUE:20170:24","scriptId":20170,"text":"“虽然现在尤拉进了你的队伍，但是你可别把她当一般的钢舞姬用啊！知道没！？”（小声）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707002-PROLOGUE:20170:25","scriptId":20170,"text":"“知道知道……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"707002-PROLOGUE:20170:26","scriptId":20170,"text":"这时候尤拉走了过来。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":728,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707002-PROLOGUE:20170:27","scriptId":20170,"text":"“怎么样？搞定没？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":728,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707002-PROLOGUE:20170:28","scriptId":20170,"text":"“恩～多亏了你姐姐，我们接下来只要去找这个人就行了～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":728,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":730,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707002-PROLOGUE:20170:29","scriptId":20170,"text":"“哦哦～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":730,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"707002-PROLOGUE:20170:30","scriptId":20170,"text":"尤拉一把夺过那张小纸条。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":730,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":728,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707002-PROLOGUE:20170:31","scriptId":20170,"text":"“阿芙多季娅·弗拉索夫娜？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":728,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"707002-EPILOGUE:20171:1","scriptId":20171,"text":"胜利女神特勤局的某间办公室——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":728,"right":4,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":967,"speaker":"洛伦斯·尼维尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707002-EPILOGUE:20171:2","scriptId":20171,"text":"“什么！？这都是怎么盯梢的！？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":967,"right":4,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"707002-EPILOGUE:20171:3","scriptId":20171,"text":"怒吼来自于一名男性士官，从衣着上看应该是位校级以上的指挥官。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":967,"right":4,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":967,"speaker":"洛伦斯·尼维尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707002-EPILOGUE:20171:4","scriptId":20171,"text":"“这两个人有多重要他们到底知不知道！？亏我还专门抽调了钢舞姬过去！真是太让我失望了！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":967,"right":4,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"707002-EPILOGUE:20171:5","scriptId":20171,"text":"桌子被拍得“啪啪”直响，论谁都能看出这位指挥官的愤怒。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":967,"right":4,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":966,"speaker":"克莱尔·杜邦","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707002-EPILOGUE:20171:6","scriptId":20171,"text":"“怎么了？洛伦斯？对着桌子生气？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":967,"right":966,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"707002-EPILOGUE:20171:7","scriptId":20171,"text":"被称作洛伦斯的军官抬头一看，门口站着一位非常冷艳的女子，她穿着同级位的军服，应该也是位高级指挥官。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":967,"right":966,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":967,"speaker":"洛伦斯·尼维尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707002-EPILOGUE:20171:8","scriptId":20171,"text":"“克莱尔？你来干什么？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":967,"right":966,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"707002-EPILOGUE:20171:9","scriptId":20171,"text":"洛伦斯一脸没好气地问道。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":967,"right":966,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":966,"speaker":"克莱尔·杜邦","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707002-EPILOGUE:20171:10","scriptId":20171,"text":"“我在走廊里听到你的吼声，就过来看看。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":967,"right":966,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":967,"speaker":"洛伦斯·尼维尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707002-EPILOGUE:20171:11","scriptId":20171,"text":"“我很好，没你的事情了，滚！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":967,"right":966,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":966,"speaker":"克莱尔·杜邦","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707002-EPILOGUE:20171:12","scriptId":20171,"text":"“不就是旅行者遗迹的事情嘛，进展不顺利？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":967,"right":966,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"707002-EPILOGUE:20171:13","scriptId":20171,"text":"面对克莱尔一副忍不住要笑的样子，洛伦斯反而冷静了下来。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":967,"right":966,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":967,"speaker":"洛伦斯·尼维尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707002-EPILOGUE:20171:14","scriptId":20171,"text":"“你怎么知道这件事情？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":967,"right":966,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":966,"speaker":"克莱尔·杜邦","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707002-EPILOGUE:20171:15","scriptId":20171,"text":"“啊？嗯……忘了～大概是哪里漏风的时候听到的～？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":967,"right":966,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"707002-EPILOGUE:20171:16","scriptId":20171,"text":"洛伦斯用冰冷的眼神仅仅盯住克莱尔。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":967,"right":966,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":967,"speaker":"洛伦斯·尼维尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707002-EPILOGUE:20171:17","scriptId":20171,"text":"“你知道多少？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":967,"right":966,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":966,"speaker":"克莱尔·杜邦","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707002-EPILOGUE:20171:18","scriptId":20171,"text":"“大概……和你一样多？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":967,"right":966,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":967,"speaker":"洛伦斯·尼维尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707002-EPILOGUE:20171:19","scriptId":20171,"text":"“！！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":967,"right":966,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"707002-EPILOGUE:20171:20","scriptId":20171,"text":"洛伦斯的眼中凝聚着愤怒。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":967,"right":966,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":967,"speaker":"洛伦斯·尼维尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707002-EPILOGUE:20171:21","scriptId":20171,"text":"“滚！别想和我抢功劳，这件事情我自己就能处理！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":967,"right":966,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":966,"speaker":"克莱尔·杜邦","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707002-EPILOGUE:20171:22","scriptId":20171,"text":"“如果功劳三七分的话，我倒是可以帮你一把～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":967,"right":966,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"707002-EPILOGUE:20171:23","scriptId":20171,"text":"克莱尔一副非常游刃有余的样子，不由得让洛伦斯有点奇怪。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":967,"right":966,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":967,"speaker":"洛伦斯·尼维尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707002-EPILOGUE:20171:24","scriptId":20171,"text":"“怎么说？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":967,"right":966,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":966,"speaker":"克莱尔·杜邦","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707002-EPILOGUE:20171:25","scriptId":20171,"text":"“我可以给你个提示～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":967,"right":966,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"707002-EPILOGUE:20171:26","scriptId":20171,"text":"洛伦斯陷入了短暂的沉默，他飞快的在脑内进行着价值的衡量。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":967,"right":966,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"707002-EPILOGUE:20171:27","scriptId":20171,"text":"最后——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":967,"right":966,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":967,"speaker":"洛伦斯·尼维尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707002-EPILOGUE:20171:28","scriptId":20171,"text":"“好吧，视情报的价值，我可以分你一到三成的功劳。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":967,"right":966,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":966,"speaker":"克莱尔·杜邦","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707002-EPILOGUE:20171:29","scriptId":20171,"text":"“那就好办了～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":967,"right":966,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"707002-EPILOGUE:20171:30","scriptId":20171,"text":"克莱尔拿出一盒录像带，放到洛伦斯的桌上。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":967,"right":966,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":966,"speaker":"克莱尔·杜邦","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707002-EPILOGUE:20171:31","scriptId":20171,"text":"“我想这个东西可能会对你有所帮助～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":967,"right":966,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"707002-EPILOGUE:20171:32","scriptId":20171,"text":"克莱尔说完转身离开，在走到门口的时候，她停了下来。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":967,"right":966,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":966,"speaker":"克莱尔·杜邦","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707002-EPILOGUE:20171:33","scriptId":20171,"text":"“不要忘了你的承诺哟～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":967,"right":966,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":967,"speaker":"洛伦斯·尼维尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"707002-EPILOGUE:20171:34","scriptId":20171,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":967,"right":966,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"707002-EPILOGUE:20171:35","scriptId":20171,"text":"克莱尔离开后，办公室里只留下了洛伦斯和那卷录像带。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":967,"right":966,"section":3,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
